# Frontend UI

Follow `frontend/AGENTS.md`. This is Next.js 16 — check `frontend/node_modules/next/dist/docs/` for current APIs.

1. Build or update the Design Card before any page section.
2. Put new colors, type sizes, radii, shadows, and spacing on the card first.
3. Components use `var(--token)` only — no raw hex or one-off `px` for those values.
4. Tailwind is for layout. Do not invent a second palette in `@theme`.
5. Hero is headline + one line + one primary CTA. Do not add extra chrome.
6. Server Components first. Semantic HTML, visible focus, WCAG AA, mobile-first, `prefers-reduced-motion`.
7. USA is English. Perú and Latam are Spanish in every UI string.
